      "gregobaseId": 78,
      "officePart": "in",
      "incipit": "Judica me",
      "properSourcePath": "Tempora/Quad5-0",
      "sourceSection": "Introitus",
      "sourceBlobSha": "f2395993e50862261732847c2bcb4a999bbdef1d",
      "latinExcerpt": "v. Júdica me, Deus, et discérne causam meam de gente non sancta: ab hómine iníquo et dolóso éripe me: quia tu es Deus meus et fortitúdo mea.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 49,
      "officePart": "gr",
      "incipit": "Tenuisti manum",
      "properSourcePath": "Tempora/Quad6-0",
      "sourceSection": "Graduale",
      "sourceBlobSha": "9d0de35b80e978aa01d8b194ae7068a7ee14714b",
      "latinExcerpt": "Tenuísti manum déxteram meam: et in voluntáte tua deduxísti me: et cum glória assumpsísti me.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 124,
      "officePart": "in",
      "incipit": "Vultum tuum",
      "properSourcePath": "Tempora/Pasc6-0",
      "sourceSection": "Introitus",
      "sourceBlobSha": "ed8d4af1759f2641dc64d342c922f3d4f4564b7c",
      "latinExcerpt": "v. Exáudi, Dómine, vocem meam, qua clamávi ad te, allelúja: tibi dixit cor meum, quæsívi vultum tuum, vultum tuum, Dómine, requíram: ne avértas fáciem",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 107,
      "officePart": "al",
      "incipit": "Non vos relinquam",
      "properSourcePath": "Tempora/Pasc6-0",
      "sourceSection": "Graduale",
      "sourceBlobSha": "ed8d4af1759f2641dc64d342c922f3d4f4564b7c",
      "latinExcerpt": "V. Non vos relínquam órphanos: vado, et vénio ad vos, et gaudébit cor vestrum. Allelúja.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 211,
      "officePart": "of",
      "incipit": "Ascendit Deus",
      "properSourcePath": "Tempora/Pasc6-0",
      "sourceSection": "Offertorium",
      "sourceBlobSha": "ed8d4af1759f2641dc64d342c922f3d4f4564b7c",
      "latinExcerpt": "Ascéndit Deus in jubilatióne, et Dóminus in voce tubæ, allelúja.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 134,
      "officePart": "al",
      "incipit": "Salvum me fac",
      "properSourcePath": "Tempora/Pent02-0",
      "sourceSection": "Graduale",
      "sourceBlobSha": "934264dad5ea530084fc8dfe15eed79edf07c607",
      "latinExcerpt": "Dómine, Deus meus, in te sperávi: salvum me fac ex ómnibus persequéntibus me et líbera me. Allelúja.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 189,
      "officePart": "al",
      "incipit": "Propitius esto (All.)",
      "properSourcePath": "Tempora/Pent04-0",
      "sourceSection": "Graduale",
      "sourceBlobSha": "bb3f6bc65d635934faf7cf20092d1bfb38a2db86",
      "latinExcerpt": "Propítius esto, Dómine, peccátis nostris: ne quando dicant gentes: Ubi est Deus eórum?",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 38,
      "officePart": "gr",
      "incipit": "Domine Deus virtutum",
      "properSourcePath": "Tempora/Pent05-0",
      "sourceSection": "Graduale",
      "sourceBlobSha": "2cc7d77d47defc63e10812988aa49bb5be0b953b",
      "latinExcerpt": "V. Dómine, Deus virtútum, exáudi preces servórum tuórum.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 143,
      "officePart": "of",
      "incipit": "Benedicam Dominum",
      "properSourcePath": "Tempora/Pent05-0",
      "sourceSection": "Offertorium",
      "sourceBlobSha": "2cc7d77d47defc63e10812988aa49bb5be0b953b",
      "latinExcerpt": "Benedícam Dóminum, qui tríbuit mihi intelléctum: providébam Deum in conspéctu meo semper: quóniam a dextris est mihi, ne commóvear.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 77,
      "officePart": "al",
      "incipit": "Omnes gentes plaudite (All)",
      "properSourcePath": "Tempora/Pent07-0",
      "sourceSection": "Graduale",
      "sourceBlobSha": "cd63373d6ad1fac0015b09f084c9634f585066c6",
      "latinExcerpt": "Omnes gentes, pláudite mánibus: jubiláte Deo in voce exsultatiónis. Allelúja.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 63,
      "officePart": "tr",
      "incipit": "Cor meum",
      "properSourcePath": "Tempora/Pent11-0",
      "sourceSection": "Graduale",
      "sourceBlobSha": "da5b4cd6cfad7938787fac5b2bd15e3748586288",
      "latinExcerpt": "In Deo sperávit cor meum, et adjútus sum: et reflóruit caro mea, et ex voluntáte mea confitébor illi.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 172,
      "officePart": "in",
      "incipit": "Da pacem",
      "properSourcePath": "Tempora/Pent18-0",
      "sourceSection": "Introitus",
      "sourceBlobSha": "12148b5f40ddfa4bb516ed6674e43911c2b58b4a",
      "latinExcerpt": "v. Da pacem, Dómine, sustinéntibus te, ut prophétæ tui fidéles inveniántur: exáudi preces servi tui et plebis tuæ Israël",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 44,
      "officePart": "gr",
      "incipit": "Dirigatur oratio mea",
      "properSourcePath": "Tempora/Pent19-0",
      "sourceSection": "Graduale",
      "sourceBlobSha": "1677574533e0c814c2afd9b001b7a5b6f44b22b3",
      "latinExcerpt": "Dirigátur orátio mea, sicut incénsum in conspéctu tuo, Dómine.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 63,
      "officePart": "tr",
      "incipit": "Cor meum",
      "properSourcePath": "Tempora/Pent20-0",
      "sourceSection": "Graduale",
      "sourceBlobSha": "65fb02c3c410c9ae4d969df7d862a7b078e9af89",
      "latinExcerpt": "Parátum cor meum, Deus, parátum cor meum: cantábo, et psallam tibi, glória mea. Allelúja.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 67,
      "officePart": "of",
      "incipit": "Recordare mei",
      "properSourcePath": "Tempora/Pent22-0",
      "sourceSection": "Offertorium",
      "sourceBlobSha": "3d817ff7d32eb61a606a96bddfa94193427941ae",
      "latinExcerpt": "Recordáre mei, Dómine, omni potentátui dóminans: et da sermónem rectum in os meum, ut pláceant verba mea in conspéctu príncipis.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 205,
      "officePart": "gr",
      "incipit": "Omnes de Saba",
      "properSourcePath": "Sancti/01-06",
      "sourceSection": "Graduale",
      "sourceBlobSha": "14ecd813980527a8e8180d51153b16e1c115d1d7",
      "latinExcerpt": "Omnes de Saba vénient, aurum et thus deferéntes, et laudem Dómino annuntiántes.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 50,
      "officePart": "gr",
      "incipit": "Suscepimus Deus (Grad.)",
      "properSourcePath": "Sancti/02-02",
      "sourceSection": "Graduale",
      "sourceBlobSha": "16c4f9b4cf99f6719a7701ad71c9f4789600854d",
      "latinExcerpt": "Suscépimus, Deus, misericórdiam tuam in médio templi tui: secúndum nomen tuum, Deus, ita et laus tua in fines terræ.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 5,
      "officePart": "in",
      "incipit": "Vidi civitatem",
      "properSourcePath": "Sancti/02-11",
      "sourceSection": "Introitus",
      "sourceBlobSha": "531e88caf016824e493ff4027e767e5b6934e3fa",
      "latinExcerpt": "v. Vidi civitátem sanctam, Jerúsalem novam, descendéntem de cœlo a Deo, parátam sicut sponsam ornátam viro suo.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 27,
      "officePart": "gr",
      "incipit": "Flores apparuerunt",
      "properSourcePath": "Sancti/02-11",
      "sourceSection": "Graduale",
      "sourceBlobSha": "531e88caf016824e493ff4027e767e5b6934e3fa",
      "latinExcerpt": "Flores apparuérunt in terra nostra, tempus putatiónis advénit, vox túrturis audíta est in terra nostra.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 80,
      "officePart": "co",
      "incipit": "Visitasti terram",
      "properSourcePath": "Sancti/02-11",
      "sourceSection": "Communio",
      "sourceBlobSha": "531e88caf016824e493ff4027e767e5b6934e3fa",
      "latinExcerpt": "Visitásti terram et inebriásti eam, multiplicásti locupletáre eam.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 153,
      "officePart": "gr",
      "incipit": "Beatus vir qui timet (Grad.)",
      "properSourcePath": "Sancti/03-19",
      "sourceSection": "Graduale",
      "sourceBlobSha": "1d74084bac51845b47663157d120295b31e16c2b",
      "latinExcerpt": "Beátus vir, qui timet Dóminum: in mandátis ejus cupit nimis.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 139,
      "officePart": "co",
      "incipit": "Joseph fili David",
      "properSourcePath": "Sancti/03-19",
      "sourceSection": "Communio",
      "sourceBlobSha": "1d74084bac51845b47663157d120295b31e16c2b",
      "latinExcerpt": "Joseph, fili David, noli timére accípere Maríam cónjugem tuam: quod enim in ea natum est, de Spíritu Sancto est. (Allelúja.)",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 18,
      "officePart": "tr",
      "incipit": "Gaude Maria",
      "properSourcePath": "Sancti/05-31",
      "sourceSection": "Tractus",
      "sourceBlobSha": "8d1e76e3afb2dc24a884457184722be838d2175a",
      "latinExcerpt": "Gaude, María Virgo, cunctas hǽreses sola interemísti.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 133,
      "officePart": "co",
      "incipit": "Tu puer",
      "properSourcePath": "Sancti/06-24",
      "sourceSection": "Communio",
      "sourceBlobSha": "223a6fe3fdc14dbc7ba2b5d11e59b0ec545680c7",
      "latinExcerpt": "Tu, puer, Propheta Altíssimi vocaberis: præíbis enim ante fáciem Dómini paráre vias ejus.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 63,
      "officePart": "tr",
      "incipit": "Cor meum",
      "properSourcePath": "Sancti/08-06",
      "sourceSection": "Graduale",
      "sourceBlobSha": "2ba654683519aad5ebe62fbb5f36c13ccf89799a",
      "latinExcerpt": "V. Eructávit cor meum verbum bonum: dico ego ópera mea Regi.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 125,
      "officePart": "of",
      "incipit": "Gloria et divitiae",
      "properSourcePath": "Sancti/08-06",
      "sourceSection": "Offertorium",
      "sourceBlobSha": "2ba654683519aad5ebe62fbb5f36c13ccf89799a",
      "latinExcerpt": "Glória et divítiæ in domo ejus: et justítia ejus manet in sǽculum sǽculi, allelúja.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 23,
      "officePart": "in",
      "incipit": "Signum magnum",
      "properSourcePath": "Sancti/08-15",
      "sourceSection": "Introitus",
      "sourceBlobSha": "4fa6f0074f1a6581fb857b9cd6b4db9148dcf1b2",
      "latinExcerpt": "v. Signum magnum appáruit in cœlo: múlier amicta sole, et luna sub pédibus ejus, et in cápite ejus coróna stellárum duódecim.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
      "gregobaseId": 42,
      "officePart": "in",
      "incipit": "Cantate Domino",
      "properSourcePath": "Sancti/08-15",
      "sourceSection": "Introitus",
      "sourceBlobSha": "4fa6f0074f1a6581fb857b9cd6b4db9148dcf1b2",
      "latinExcerpt": "Cantáte Dómino cánticum novum: quóniam mirabília fecit.",
      "evidenceLevel": "LATIN_SECTION_OCCURRENCE_NOT_SELECTED_1962_PROPER"
    },
    {
